Of the compounds encompassed by Formula XVII, certain substituents are prefeπed. For instance, the compounds wherein R54 or R55 are lower alkyl groups are prefeπed. Also highly prefeπed are the compounds wherein Ya is a 2-phenyl-2-oxoethyl or a 2-[4'-bromophenyl]-2-oxoethyl group. Representative of the compounds of Formula XVII are: 

